35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The recruiters can't place field crews fast enough. That is a problem for hardware.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,The write-off was a company with hourly crews. The exits were quiet software.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,Our credit line treats subscription contracts as worthless. That is a huge risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Hardware needs outside appraisals. That adds six weeks to our audit.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Hardware lost five months to parts shortages. Software never missed a release.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, that confirms my fear. We can't staff the field teams quickly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"@May, if subscriptions are worthless to the bank, we are exposed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, exactly. We need assets we can borrow against.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, and the audit delay makes it worse. We can't close the books.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, the security review for medical data is also three quarters long.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"So, software is faster to staff and easier to audit?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,The retention data shows software kept customers better too.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"And the credit line favors physical stock, but we don't have that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The independent checks show software reports are opaque, but at least they are fast.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The delivery risk is much lower for pure software.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards the software options.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. The history supports it.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"I am worried about the cash flow, but the risk is lower.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,The reporting burden is manageable if we avoid hardware.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,The obstacles are clearer and less severe for software.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
